  "name": "signup-flow",
  "type": "hyperframes:block",
  "title": "Signup Flow",
  "description": "A signup card composition: a real shadcn-style card (header, labeled Full Name / Email / Password / Confirm fields, primary + Google-outline buttons, sign-in footer) whose cursor fills each field top-to-bottom, then clicks Create account (hover → press → loading → success) as a success toast slides in. A pure orchestrator — every channel comes from a composed primitive's transition hook. Compiled for deterministic HyperFrames playback by Hyfrme.",
  "tags": [
    "ui",
    "primitive",
    "remocn-port"
  ],
  "author": "Hyfrme",
